A1 L2: on a quicktest map with LeaningScrub (mandrake.rm.biomes) and all five DLC, the item's own crown repro -- pad = map centre -45,+45, RM_Stall locked, RM_CrownVenomvine at the anchor, 3 RM_Dustflutter at (x+16+i, z+4-4i) faction none, site colonists NOT drafted and wildlife NOT removed; jobs (jawa/site_state) every 50 ticks for 500 ticks and on to 2000, AlwaysFlee defs (Tornado, RM_SteamDevil, RM_SandBusterMound, RM_DuneGale) within 18 -- in five arms (mob_on, mob_off, mob_off_bloom_off, mob_off_scent_off, mob_on_quiet): every dustflutter that ends up >= 23 cells off in mob_on/mob_off has its non-wander job named and its cause attributed (the toggle arm that stays near, or an AlwaysFlee thing within 18), no airborne dustflutter wanders in the Stall, and the quiet mob (mob_on_quiet, or mob_on when no far move recurs) holds >= 2 of 3 within 6 cells of the crown stand. An unnamed or unattributed far move, or a mob that does not gather, is exit 1, never a pass; an unstaged site is exit 2.
